  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Santosh Alias Bablu Pralhad Koli vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 30 September, 2025 1 915ABA1708.2025.odt In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad. 915 Anticipatory Bail Application No. 1708 Of 2025 Santosh @ Bablu Pralhad Koli Versus The State Of Maharashtra And Another ... Mr. Joydeep Chatterji - Advocate for Applicant Mr. C. V. Bhadane - App for State ... Coram : Neeraj P. Dhote, J. Dated : 30Th September, 2025 Per Court : -",
    "facts": "2. The Informant, who is the Food Safety Officer got the information regarding the transportation of banned gutkha and tobacco from the State of Madhya Pradesh. A trap was laid, and the vehicle was intercepted. The articles worth Rs. 8,16,000/- came to be seized from the said vehicle on the border of Maharashtra and Madhya Pradesh. The Applicant was present in the said vehicle but he managed to escape. The only non-bailable Section is 123 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita. Prima facie, there is no allegation of administering the banned articles. The person who sold the said articles has already been protected by this Court vide order dated 22 nd July, 2025 passed in Anticipatory Bail Application No. 1154 of 2025.",
